WEBVTT

00:01:58.700 --> 00:02:01.937
But anyone who's ever had
or knows small children knows,

00:02:01.961 --> 00:02:03.977
they're incredibly complex organisms.

00:02:04.001 --> 00:02:07.697
If you wanted to convince them to do
something they don't want to do,

00:02:07.721 --> 00:02:08.879
it's very difficult.

00:02:08.903 --> 00:02:10.919
So when we think
about future technologies,

00:02:10.943 --> 00:02:14.161
we actually think of using
bacteria and viruses --

00:02:14.185 --> 00:02:15.393
simple organisms.

00:02:15.417 --> 00:02:18.073
Can you convince them
to work with a new toolbox,

00:02:18.097 --> 00:02:21.347
so they can build a structure
that will be important to me?

00:02:21.371 --> 00:02:23.672
Also, when we think
about future technologies,

00:02:23.696 --> 00:02:25.909
we start with the beginning of Earth.

00:02:25.933 --> 00:02:29.676
Basically, it took a billion years
to have life on Earth.

00:02:29.700 --> 00:02:31.811
And very rapidly,
they became multi-cellular,